{
  "name": "A messy study of support",
  "description": "A messy study of support.",
  "schemaVersion": 8,
  "lastModified": "2026-10-20T00:00:00.000Z",
  "codebook": {
    "ego": {
      "variables": {
        "ego_consent": {
          "name": "consent",
          "type": "boolean",
          "component": "Boolean",
          "options": [
            {
              "label": "Yes, I agree to take part",
              "value": true
            },
            {
              "label": "No, I do not want to take part",
              "value": false,
              "negative": true
            }
          ],
          "validation": {
            "required": true
          }
        },
        "ego_age": {
          "name": "age",
          "type": "number",
          "component": "Number",
          "validation": {
            "minValue": 18,
            "maxValue": 99
          }
        },
        "ego_age_2": {
          "name": "age_2",
          "type": "text",
          "component": "Text"
        },
        "ego_smokes": {
          "name": "smokes",
          "type": "boolean",
          "component": "Boolean",
          "options": [
            {
              "label": "Yes",
              "value": true
            },
            {
              "label": "No",
              "value": false,
              "negative": true
            }
          ]
        },
        "ego_mood": {
          "name": "mood",
          "type": "text",
          "component": "Text"
        },
        "ego_scale": {
          "name": "scale",
          "type": "ordinal",
          "component": "LikertScale",
          "options": [
            {
              "label": "a",
              "value": 1
            },
            {
              "label": "b",
              "value": 2
            },
            {
              "label": "c",
              "value": 3
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    "node": {
      "person": {
        "name": "Person",
        "icon": "add-a-person",
        "color": "node-color-seq-1",
        "shape": {
          "default": "circle"
        },
        "variables": {
          "person_name": {
            "name": "name",
            "type": "text",
            "component": "Text",
            "validation": {
              "required": true,
              "unique": true
            }
          },
          "person_layout": {
            "name": "layout",
            "type": "layout"
          },
          "person_first_name": {
            "name": "person_first_name",
            "type": "text",
            "component": "Text"
          },
          "person_closeness": {
            "name": "person_closeness",
            "type": "ordinal",
            "component": "RadioGroup",
            "options": [
              {
                "label": "Not",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "label": "Very",
                "value": 2
              }
            ]
          },
          "person_close": {
            "name": "close",
            "type": "boolean",
            "component": "Toggle"
          },
          "person_helper": {
            "name": "helper",
            "type": "boolean",
            "component": "Toggle"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "edge": {
      "person_2": {
        "name": "Person (tie)",
        "color": "edge-color-seq-1"
      }
    }
  },
  "stages": [
    {
      "id": "researcher_notes",
      "type": "Information",
      "label": "Researcher notes (delete before fielding)",
      "title": "Notes for the research team",
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "text",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "**About this draft.** Sketch drafted this protocol from a study description. Review every stage before fielding.\n\n**Study.** A messy study of support.\n\n**Changes Sketch made.**\n- Two node types / relationships use id \"person\"; the second became \"person_2\". Give each its own id.\n- Consent attribute \"participant_consent\" was replaced by the built-in consent question (includeConsent); the interview ends if the participant declines.\n- Two different attributes use id \"age\"; the second became \"age_2\" and every reference to \"age\" points at the first. Give each attribute its own id.\n- ordered attribute \"mood\" needs at least 2 options; it was turned into free text.\n- optionScores of \"scale\" must be one distinct whole number per option (3); they were dropped and options scored 1..n.\n- Stage \"early\" uses \"person\" nodes before any earlier nameGenerator creates them. The stage was removed.\n- Skip condition tests \"smokes\" on egoAttributes, which no EARLIER stage collects.\n- mode skip_if has no usable conditions; the stage is always shown.\n- Form attribute \"undefined_attr\" is not an attribute of egoAttributes. Matching attributes there: age (number), age_2 (text), smokes (yes_no), mood (text), scale (ordered).\n- Form attribute \"closeness\" is not an attribute of egoAttributes. Matching attributes there: age (number), age_2 (text), smokes (yes_no), mood (text), scale (ordered).\n- Prompt without text removed.\n- a yes_no value must be \"yes\" or \"no\" (got \"maybe\"). Condition removed.\n- Bin attribute \"close\" on node type \"person\" is yes_no, but this needs ordered or single_choice. Matching attributes there: person_closeness (ordered).\n- narrative \"story\" needs an EARLIER sociogram of node type \"person\" (it reuses that map's positions). Add one, or remove the narrative. The stage was removed.\n- relationship \"knows\" is not declared. Declared: person_2.\n- Highlight \"person_closeness\" is ordered; highlights must be yes_no. Prompt removed.\n- relationship \"person\" is not declared. Declared: person_2.\n- relationshipForm \"edge_form\" has no valid relationship. The stage was removed.\n- mode show_only_if has no usable conditions; the stage is always shown."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "welcome",
      "type": "Information",
      "label": "Welcome",
      "title": "Welcome",
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "text",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "Hi"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "consent",
      "type": "EgoForm",
      "label": "Consent",
      "introductionPanel": {
        "title": "Taking part",
        "text": "Do you consent?"
      },
      "form": {
        "fields": [
          {
            "variable": "ego_consent",
            "prompt": "Do you agree to take part in this study?"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "about",
      "type": "EgoForm",
      "label": "About",
      "introductionPanel": {
        "title": "About you",
        "text": "Please answer the following questions about yourself."
      },
      "form": {
        "fields": [
          {
            "variable": "ego_age",
            "prompt": "Age?"
          },
          {
            "variable": "ego_smokes",
            "prompt": "Do you smoke?"
          }
        ]
      },
      "skipLogic": {
        "action": "SKIP",
        "filter": {
          "rules": [
            {
              "id": "rule_1",
              "type": "ego",
              "options": {
                "attribute": "ego_consent",
                "operator": "EXACTLY",
                "value": false
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "destination": {
          "type": "finish"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "names",
      "type": "NameGenerator",
      "label": "Names",
      "subject": {
        "entity": "node",
        "type": "person"
      },
      "prompts": [
        {
          "id": "p1",
          "text": "Who?",
          "additionalAttributes": [
            {
              "variable": "person_close",
              "value": true
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "behaviours": {
        "minNodes": 5,
        "maxNodes": 5
      },
      "form": {
        "title": "Add a person",
        "fields": [
          {
            "variable": "person_name",
            "prompt": "What is the name of this person?"
          },
          {
            "variable": "person_first_name",
            "prompt": "Name?"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "bins",
      "type": "OrdinalBin",
      "label": "Bins",
      "subject": {
        "entity": "node",
        "type": "person"
      },
      "prompts": [
        {
          "id": "p1",
          "text": "Closeness",
          "variable": "person_closeness",
          "color": "ord-color-seq-1"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "map",
      "type": "Sociogram",
      "label": "Map",
      "subject": {
        "entity": "node",
        "type": "person"
      },
      "background": {
        "concentricCircles": 4,
        "skewedTowardCenter": true
      },
      "behaviours": {
        "automaticLayout": true
      },
      "prompts": [
        {
          "id": "p1",
          "text": "Mark helpers",
          "layout": {
            "layoutVariable": "person_layout"
          },
          "highlight": {
            "allowHighlighting": true,
            "variable": "person_helper"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "mood_form",
      "type": "EgoForm",
      "label": "Mood form",
      "introductionPanel": {
        "title": "About you",
        "text": "Please answer the following questions about yourself."
      },
      "form": {
        "fields": [
          {
            "variable": "ego_mood",
            "prompt": "Mood?"
          },
          {
            "variable": "ego_scale",
            "prompt": "Scale?"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
